Comment: 0,0:12:15.69,0:12:21.78,EG,,0,0,0,,Mobile Suit Gundam
Comment: 0,0:12:23.20,0:12:28.79,EG,,0,0,0,,Mobile Suit Gundam
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.71,0:01:46.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The Earth Federation's Third Fleet...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.50,0:01:49.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}...staged an attack on\Nthe space fortress, Solomon...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.46,0:01:53.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}...and broke into it using\Ntheir new weapon, the Solar System.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.26,0:02:27.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I botched it. I can't believe\NI could have been so careless.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.60,0:02:34.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sleggar's G-Fighter is returning to the ship.\NIt looks like the left engine has been hit.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.76,0:02:37.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sleggar! Do you copy?! Come in!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.05,0:02:40.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I read you.{\i}\N{\i1}Landing on Deck 3.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.98,0:02:43.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Something wrong, Ensign?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.60,0:02:46.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.86,0:02:50.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Not enough missiles from starboard!\NDon't slack off.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.46,0:02:54.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Fraw Bow, bring Chief Vammas\Nup from the sub-bridge.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.87,0:02:56.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ensign Mirai.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.71,0:03:07.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Private conversations are prohibited\Nduring battle... but don't shut me out, Mirai.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.00,0:03:10.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'd like to think that I'm\Ncapable enough to watch over you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.43,0:03:12.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Bright...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.46,0:03:15.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I understand how you feel...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.43,0:03:18.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,...but I'll always be here waiting for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.20,0:03:19.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.26,0:03:21.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ensign Mirai isn't feeling well.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.15,0:03:22.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Take over her position for the time being.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.94,0:03:24.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!\NI'll relieve you now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.28,0:03:26.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Bright...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.89,0:03:30.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Anti-aircraft guns!\NObject approaching portside! Got that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.92,0:03:37.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Get a move on!\NDeal with the left engine when the fire's out!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.61,0:03:38.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Howard!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.84,0:03:42.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You gotta replace the busted armor panels.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.09,0:03:45.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And the fuel pump to engine no. 2.\NI'm pretty sure there's a leak.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.37,0:03:47.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Okay. I'll get on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.24,0:03:51.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And fill it up with fuel and ammo.\NMake it fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.14,0:03:52.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Please give us 15 minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.94,0:03:56.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You've got 10.\NI've gotta get re-fuelled myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.63,0:04:00.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hurry up!\NWe've got 10 minutes to fix it!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.64,0:04:01.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Howard!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.04,0:04:04.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Where's Lieutenant Sleggar?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.03,0:04:06.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He was headed toward the waiting box.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.31,0:04:07.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Okay. Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.91,0:04:27.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Lieutenant! You're not injured.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.46,0:04:32.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ensign. What are you doing\Nin a place like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.39,0:04:33.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.87,0:04:46.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm so glad...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.29,0:04:50.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ensign. Enough of that.\NDon't be foolish.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.54,0:04:53.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Lieutenant Sleggar. All prepared for takeoff!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.69,0:04:55.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,On my way!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.36,0:04:56.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,See you later.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.86,0:04:58.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Lieutenant...!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.95,0:05:06.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Please don't die.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.23,0:05:15.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ensign Mirai... When you're young,\Nthings can be very chaotic.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.17,0:05:19.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You shouldn't take your own feelings\Ntoo seriously at the moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.84,0:05:21.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's that supposed to mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.38,0:05:24.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hm...? Well... it doesn't matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.68,0:05:25.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Lieutenant...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.98,0:05:33.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ensign, I'm not the kind of man\Nwho deserves your affection.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.02,0:05:36.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No, Sleggar...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.42,0:05:38.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,To me, you're...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.94,0:05:42.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You dazzle me, Ensign.\NWe're worlds apart.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.49,0:05:43.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.78,0:05:48.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is just a cheap ring...\Nbut it's a memento of my mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.79,0:05:51.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'd hate to lose it in space.\NHold onto it for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.74,0:06:00.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.90,0:06:16.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Look after that ring, Ensign!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.52,0:06:32.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Lieutenant...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.24,0:06:43.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}At Granada, Kycilia's base to the south\Nof the moon's Ural Mountains...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.16,0:06:47.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}...a fleet was preparing to take off\Nin an attempt to rescue Solomon.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.56,0:06:50.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The fleet had been swiftly assembled\Nunder the command of M'Quve.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.20,0:07:17.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Not bad... There are a lot of\Nenemy forces left inside the base.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.71,0:07:19.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why you...!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.74,0:08:00.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Be careful! There's a new weapon! It's huge!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.17,0:08:01.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What?! How many are there?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.96,0:08:04.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wait. It seems there's only one new model.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.34,0:08:06.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The rest are just Rick Doms and Zakus.\NLet's get 'em!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.59,0:08:10.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No! Hang on!\NWe don't know their strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.93,0:08:18.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Those measly pawns are coming this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.06,0:08:23.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Show them how the Big Zam differs from\Nany other mobile armor or mobile suit!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.40,0:08:23.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.75,0:08:46.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If you're gonna come out, come out already!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.97,0:08:53.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,My beams...!\NIt's a monster!!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.06,0:08:59.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A monster?\NI'll check it out!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.19,0:09:04.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is the control room!\NYour Excellency!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.27,0:09:05.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}What is it?!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.19,0:09:06.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Where are you, Your Excellency?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.65,0:09:11.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll fight in the Big Zam!\NSo many enemy mobile suits have entered.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.03,0:09:13.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}But our remaining fleets{\i}\N{\i1}are about to take off!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.95,0:09:15.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}There's no need for you to fight in person!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.53,0:09:16.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.62,0:09:20.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We've reached the point where\Nwe must use all our fighting strength!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.37,0:09:23.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Zenna...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.92,0:09:25.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mineva...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.46,0:09:27.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I hope you've escaped to safety.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.82,0:09:53.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's an escape rocket. One of ours.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.74,0:09:54.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Its course?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.82,0:09:57.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It appears to have been launched\Nfrom Solomon, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.62,0:09:59.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Bring it in under remote control.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.83,0:10:03.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Captain, the battle at Solomon\Nseems rather desperate.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.34,0:10:03.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.83,0:10:06.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ignore the escape rocket and...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.09,0:10:10.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I beg your pardon. But you don't\Nunderstand the feelings of soldiers in space.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.68,0:10:11.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.22,0:10:12.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,At times like this...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.72,0:10:15.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Soldiers can fight in space,\Nrisking their own lives...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.60,0:10:18.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,...because they believe their comrades\Nwill come to rescue them.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.31,0:10:21.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If we don't hurry, they'll drift out of range.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.02,0:10:25.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All right. Bring it in.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.36,0:10:26.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.58,0:10:47.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mineva...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.55,0:10:51.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's an allied fleet.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.55,0:10:55.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We're saved.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.33,0:11:21.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm pleased with this thing's power.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.29,0:11:24.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But at this rate,\Nour base will be badly damaged.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.26,0:11:24.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Control room!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.26,0:11:26.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Yes, Your Excellency.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.17,0:11:28.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How many vessels do we have left?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.32,0:11:30.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The enemy's new weapon and mobile suits...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.54,0:11:33.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,...have destroyed or immobilized\Nthree-quarters of our vessels.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.67,0:11:37.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All right! Tell the rest to charge\Nstraight through the enemy's main fleet!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.38,0:11:39.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Sir?!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.09,0:11:42.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And I'll lead the remaining Rick Doms\Nand Zakus out of Solomon!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.85,0:11:45.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Sir! Good luck, Your Excellency!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.06,0:11:47.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thanks, and the same to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.00,0:12:39.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sir, we've confirmed\Nenemy fleet leaving Granada.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.49,0:12:41.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We can hold on a little longer, correct?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.07,0:12:41.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.62,0:12:45.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But the remaining enemy vessels have\Nlaunched from the other side of Solomon.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.79,0:12:48.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Can we get them with\Nwhat's left of the Solar System?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.83,0:12:50.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We'd have a 60 percent chance of success.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.81,0:12:51.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let's give it a try.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.77,0:12:59.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Focal coordinates, 0-6-3-5!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.49,0:13:06.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Making minor adjustments to the Y-axis!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.47,0:13:08.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,0-0-4! 0-0-2!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.27,0:13:13.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All fleets will finish off the enemy\Nafter we focus the Solar System!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.92,0:13:14.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Full speed ahead!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.03,0:13:21.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Forget the ships we passed.\NOthers are ahead! Hit whatever you can!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.34,0:13:35.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Next...?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.41,0:13:42.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Damn, I'm good!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.43,0:13:43.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Uh-oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.85,0:13:50.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm too late!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.60,0:13:54.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What kind of machine\Ncould destroy mobile suits like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.19,0:13:58.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.75,0:14:10.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.70,0:14:25.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.61,0:14:39.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Another vessel leaving Solomon!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.26,0:14:42.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Receiving Solar System's\Ncoded focusing signal!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.13,0:14:45.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's that?!\NThe Solar System's still alive?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.00,0:15:00.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Remaining ships will charge\Nthe enemy's main force!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.09,0:15:00.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.84,0:15:02.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's the Big Zam's target?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.21,0:15:03.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The command vessel that's in the rear!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.92,0:15:05.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ignore the small fry!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.97,0:15:14.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sayla's craft has been hit!\NWe'll take her in through Deck 3!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.59,0:15:15.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Do it quickly!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.45,0:15:20.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Once she's inside, we'll pursue the large\Nmobile armor that launched from Solomon.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.92,0:15:21.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mirai?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.53,0:15:26.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry for the trouble, Lieutenant.\NI'm better now.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.09,0:15:28.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All right. Vammas,\Nplease return to the sub-bridge.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.95,0:15:30.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.11,0:15:34.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Bring the White Base around\N180 degrees, Mirai! Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.46,0:15:35.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.29,0:15:41.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Salamis ships!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.30,0:15:44.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No problem! Fire forward beam!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.39,0:15:52.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I knew it!\NThat mobile armor isn't just big!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.39,0:15:54.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I just saw that thing deflect the beams!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.64,0:15:57.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Which means only missiles will work.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.73,0:16:00.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If we don't do something,\Nwe'll just have more casualties!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.59,0:16:06.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The Big Zam will charge the main fleet.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.33,0:16:10.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But first give a flare to signal\Nthat all units are to escape!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.11,0:16:11.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But sir...!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.07,0:16:14.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Our forces have been battered too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.70,0:16:17.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We are going to abandon Solomon.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.45,0:16:20.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Switch control over to my panel.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.29,0:16:22.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And you men must escape as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.38,0:16:24.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But... Your Excellency?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.21,0:16:25.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't waste your lives!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.34,0:16:30.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We've got Doms and Zakus.\NThey can pull you off the battlefield!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.09,0:16:31.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Uh, yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.14,0:16:33.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Now! Send out the flare signal!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.69,0:16:35.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm taking over the Big Zam!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.23,0:16:46.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I never expected Solomon\Nto fall so easily.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.07,0:16:56.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's the Gundam!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.33,0:17:01.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I just can't fire on unarmed men.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.38,0:17:12.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't underestimate the Big Zam!\NThose long-range beams have no effect!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.15,0:17:15.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll take as many of you as I can\Nwith me to hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.81,0:17:28.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The large mobile suit is emitting\Na powerful magnetic field.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.11,0:17:30.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Missiles! Intercept with missiles!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.21,0:17:45.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's way too strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.38,0:17:48.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,See?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.63,0:17:53.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Once the Big Zam is mass-produced\Nwe'll put an end to the Federation in no time!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.15,0:18:06.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Lieutenant Sleggar?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.82,0:18:10.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You want us to dock...\Nand charge into them in G-Armor mode?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.25,0:18:23.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Let's do it, Chief Amuro!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.67,0:18:26.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,R-Right! But Lieutenant, what's your plan?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.38,0:18:28.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Don't talk to me about plans!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.46,0:18:32.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}With their magnetic field, all we can do{\i}\N{\i1}is get in close and try our beam weapons!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.38,0:18:33.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Gotcha!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.43,0:18:34.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}If these beam cannons fall...{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.97,0:18:37.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}...use the Gundam's beam rifle,{\i}\N{\i1}then the beam saber.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.39,0:18:41.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}With three levels of weaponry on our side,{\i}\N{\i1}even if we get shot down...{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.39,0:18:42.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Lieutenant Sleggar!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.85,0:18:47.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Forget personal feelings.\NI won't let it create any more casualties.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.90,0:18:50.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It sounds sad. But this is a war.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.11,0:18:54.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Amuro! We'll attack from below!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.01,0:19:10.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,From below?! Anti-air defenses!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.48,0:19:19.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Not over yet!!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.07,0:19:29.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Damn them!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.94,0:19:31.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Lieutenant!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.90,0:19:34.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They got him!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.79,0:19:47.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You...!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.60,0:19:54.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is a single mobile suit...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.05,0:19:58.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,...going to defeat the Big Zam?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.10,0:20:02.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No! I won't be defeated!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.11,0:20:05.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I won't let a punk like you beat me!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.28,0:20:07.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I won't be defeated!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.77,0:20:15.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,For the glory of Zeon!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.46,0:20:16.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,For my own pride!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.86,0:20:20.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You will not defeat me!\NYou will not defeat me!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.28,0:20:22.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Who is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.16,0:20:29.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.51,0:21:07.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Solomon has fallen...?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.95,0:21:09.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.61,0:21:20.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How's this? Captain, you'll take Lady Zenna\Nto Granada aboard this Gwazine.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.05,0:21:24.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll board a Chivvay so that I can\Nkeep an eye on the Federation's next move.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.85,0:21:29.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Right. We've missed our chance\Nto stage a surprise attack, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.00,0:21:30.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.29,0:21:35.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Your role as strategist depended on\NSolomon holding out until we arrived.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.48,0:21:38.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll leave a few vessels to collect intelligence\Nand rescue the men.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.94,0:21:42.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Very well. I'll help with that, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.23,0:21:53.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Tell me it's a lie.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.57,0:21:57.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You can't tell me it's a lie, can you, Amuro?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.12,0:23:22.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Char prepares himself for the next battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.09,0:23:26.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Unaware, Amuro and M'Quve fight a\Nmortal combat in an uninhabited wasteland.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.34,0:23:32.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}As she observes the battle, young Lalah\Nhas visions of her destiny calling for her.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.10,0:23:37.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Mobile Suit Gundam. Next episode...\NThe Duel in Texas.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.18,0:23:41.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Will you be able to survive?
